<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to August 15.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name					Price     pct change</p>
<p> 1   Newcrest Mining	     2.94     10.53</p>
<p> 2   Lihir Gold		    2.01	8.65</p>
<p> 3   Goldfields		    1.63	7.24</p>
<p> 4   Normandy Min		  1.61	5.92</p>
<p> 5   Colonial			3.65	5.19</p>
<p> 6   Plutonic Rsc		  3.92	3.70</p>
<p> 7   Village Road-Pr	   3.25	3.17</p>
<p> 8   Mayne Nickless		8.26	3.12</p>
<p> 9   Broken Hill Pty	    17.50	3.00</p>
<p>10   Great Central		 2.57	2.80</p>
<p>Top 10 largest falls in week</p>
<p>Rank Name					Price     pct change</p>
<p> 1   Sthn Pac Pete		 3.10     -13.89</p>
<p> 2   RGC			     3.70	-9.76</p>
<p> 3   Aust Foundation	     2.55	-9.57</p>
<p> 4   Coca-Cola Am		 15.00	-7.06</p>
<p> 5   Hudson Conway		12.50	-6.72</p>
<p> 6   Argo  Inv		     3.33	-6.64</p>
<p> 7   Incitec			 6.37	-6.32</p>
<p> 8   Macquarie Bank	     13.35	-6.18</p>
<p> 9   Syd Hrbr Casino	     1.98	-6.16</p>
<p>10   Caltex Aust		   4.46	-5.91</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
